WEBVTT

00:24.896 --> 00:28.000
♪I woke up in a strange place♪

00:31.123 --> 00:34.080
♪The sunlight here is blindingly bright♪

00:37.216 --> 00:40.736
♪Pages rustle, and I hear a loud voice♪

00:42.656 --> 00:47.712
♪I've become the center of the story♪

00:48.608 --> 00:52.978
♪I must escape this dream♪

00:54.560 --> 00:59.160
♪Yet why does my heart
surrender before you♪

01:00.128 --> 01:04.032
♪Clearly, it's a fake plot♪

01:04.352 --> 01:06.528
♪A fake world♪

01:07.232 --> 01:12.224
♪Yet eventually,
my heart is open to you♪

01:37.088 --> 01:40.896
=My Page in the 90s=
(Adapted from "Bye, Wild Weasel")

01:41.000 --> 01:44.212
=Episode 16=

01:53.480 --> 01:55.535
(Why do girls reject you?)

01:56.008 --> 01:56.648
Mr. Gao.

02:00.630 --> 02:01.310
(Why did the confession fail?)

02:06.048 --> 02:06.887
What are you doing?

02:08.088 --> 02:09.447
You've not had water recently.

02:09.447 --> 02:10.288
I brought you some.

02:12.487 --> 02:13.528
If that's all, you may go.

02:18.487 --> 02:18.968
Mr. Gao,

02:19.848 --> 02:20.767
you're not yourself.

02:26.808 --> 02:28.207
I shouldn't have told you.

02:28.848 --> 02:30.368
I'm just concerned about you.

02:30.808 --> 02:31.767
If you don't want this,

02:32.207 --> 02:33.207
I can forget right now.

02:33.447 --> 02:34.327
Then forget it.

02:34.767 --> 02:35.848
Just tell me.

02:35.848 --> 02:37.688
I can help you figure it out, right?

02:37.927 --> 02:39.207
What could you help me with?

02:39.207 --> 02:40.128
You're not her family.

02:43.848 --> 02:45.487
Then I'll leave.

02:49.368 --> 02:50.047
(Family.)

02:54.568 --> 02:55.128
Today,

02:55.128 --> 02:56.767
I'll pick you up from school after work.

02:56.767 --> 02:58.248
Then let's grab something nice, okay?

02:58.848 --> 03:01.528
You don't have to work today,
and I don't have to go to school.

03:01.528 --> 03:02.327
Why?

03:07.487 --> 03:08.207
Haiming.

03:09.688 --> 03:10.167
Le'er.

03:13.848 --> 03:15.968
Y-You... Why are you here?

03:16.808 --> 03:18.088
Haiming, you tell her.

03:18.088 --> 03:19.248
I've taken the day off.

03:19.408 --> 03:20.368
I'm fully cooperating.

03:21.128 --> 03:22.487
Who told you to take leave?

03:22.968 --> 03:24.767
After you told me about Le'er last time,

03:24.927 --> 03:26.207
I gave it serious thought.

03:26.207 --> 03:27.927
Transferring schools is best for her.

03:28.327 --> 03:30.368
Today, I want to show her
some potential schools.

03:31.808 --> 03:32.408
Right.

03:33.248 --> 03:36.528
B-But I have to work today, don't I?

03:36.647 --> 03:37.647
Th-then you...

03:37.647 --> 03:38.808
I'm just providing options.

03:40.727 --> 03:41.927
The final decision

03:42.088 --> 03:43.167
is up to you two.

03:43.808 --> 03:44.528
Besides,

03:44.968 --> 03:47.607
the person who decides
your work schedule is right here.

03:49.207 --> 03:51.008
Right, but I...

03:51.008 --> 03:52.848
Huan'er, stop hesitating. Let's go.

03:54.207 --> 03:55.327
W-Well...

03:55.327 --> 03:58.167
Le'er, going out with Huan'er
and her boyfriend?

03:58.487 --> 03:59.008
Yes.

03:59.008 --> 04:00.767
Aren't they two a perfect match?

04:01.927 --> 04:02.927
A good-looking couple.

04:03.207 --> 04:05.088
Don't forget
to invite me to the wedding.

04:08.128 --> 04:09.047
Get in the car.

04:10.327 --> 04:10.727
Get in.

04:13.647 --> 04:15.288
Which school are you visiting first?

04:16.928 --> 04:19.128
Dele has better teaching staff.

04:20.168 --> 04:21.327
Yucai has a great campus

04:21.327 --> 04:22.368
(Yucai Secondary School Materials)
and a progressive vision.

04:22.808 --> 04:23.928
And Airely and Mingmei too.

04:23.928 --> 04:25.287
All are good private schools.

04:26.608 --> 04:28.688
Which school
has the tastiest snacks nearby?

04:30.447 --> 04:30.928
Yeah.

04:30.928 --> 04:32.847
I choose the one with the best snacks.

04:33.808 --> 04:34.847
That's way too casual.

04:35.207 --> 04:36.287
I don't think it's casual.

04:36.887 --> 04:37.847
It's very important.

04:41.608 --> 04:42.728
I'll take you somewhere.

04:55.087 --> 04:56.767
Wow, so much delicious food here.

04:56.967 --> 04:58.168
It smells amazing.

04:58.368 --> 05:00.887
This place is close
to Mingmei, Dele, and Yucai.

05:01.048 --> 05:02.087
You can take a look first.

05:02.568 --> 05:04.008
Later, we can help you analyze

05:04.008 --> 05:05.327
the details on the three schools.

05:07.168 --> 05:08.568
And I've talked with the schools.

05:08.728 --> 05:09.928
Le'er's great grades are why

05:09.928 --> 05:10.847
we have options.

05:13.048 --> 05:14.767
Huan'er, I want that chicken leg.

05:17.488 --> 05:18.287
I'll have one too.

05:25.527 --> 05:26.887
I want this grilled chicken leg.

05:27.128 --> 05:28.488
Okay, two grilled chicken legs.

05:28.488 --> 05:30.248
And an order of fries
and chicken strips.

05:30.688 --> 05:32.527
Isn't this a bit unhealthy for a kid?

05:33.407 --> 05:34.688
Do you want to win over Huan'er?

05:39.447 --> 05:39.887
Eat.

05:40.248 --> 05:42.688
One more chicken leg, please. Thanks.

05:44.728 --> 05:45.087
Here.

05:45.368 --> 05:46.168
- How much?
- Thanks.

05:46.168 --> 05:46.967
Fifteen in total.

05:47.207 --> 05:47.688
Okay.

05:48.647 --> 05:49.248
Here.

05:49.368 --> 05:49.887
Thanks.

05:49.887 --> 05:50.327
Thanks.

05:52.207 --> 05:52.808
I'll pass.

05:53.808 --> 05:54.808
You have no childhood.

05:55.447 --> 05:56.008
No childhood.

05:58.608 --> 05:59.287
That's right.

06:00.048 --> 06:01.008
CEO stereotype.

06:03.048 --> 06:03.688
Let's go then.

06:03.967 --> 06:04.488
Where to?

06:04.767 --> 06:05.896
To patch up your childhood.

06:09.960 --> 06:11.112
(This place has the best food.)

07:05.488 --> 07:07.808
How'd you get it all over your hair?

07:07.808 --> 07:09.207
You little kid.

07:21.767 --> 07:22.207
Done.

07:24.087 --> 07:26.087
Huan'er, are you sure
you two aren't dating?

07:26.407 --> 07:27.407
What do you know, kid?

07:27.407 --> 07:28.168
Eat your candy.

07:28.488 --> 07:29.368
I'm not a kid.

07:29.368 --> 07:31.287
The other day,
I saw you two downstairs...

07:36.048 --> 07:36.847
What did you see?

07:36.847 --> 07:37.728
I didn't see anything.

07:37.847 --> 07:38.527
You saw it?

07:38.527 --> 07:39.327
I really didn't.

07:39.327 --> 07:40.447
Lin Le'er, did you see it?

07:40.447 --> 07:41.608
I didn't see anything at all.

07:43.488 --> 07:44.087
You know what?

07:44.087 --> 07:46.287
Liu Yaozu from my class
is chasing after me non-stop.

07:46.688 --> 07:48.207
If he had even part of your style

07:48.207 --> 07:49.048
or looks,

07:49.327 --> 07:50.568
I'd give him the time of day.

07:51.048 --> 07:52.928
- Did you have a crush?
- No.

07:53.087 --> 07:54.728
Can't a girl have guy friends?

07:55.928 --> 07:56.647
Ignore him.

07:57.207 --> 07:58.808
I think it's perfectly normal.

07:59.008 --> 08:01.608
You spend over eight hours together
at school daily.

08:01.887 --> 08:04.928
It's only natural to develop
some vague feelings, right?

08:05.368 --> 08:06.128
No need to worry.

08:06.128 --> 08:08.767
With so many students at school,
it won't become serious.

08:09.447 --> 08:12.368
So, for two people's feelings to deepen,

08:12.847 --> 08:14.967
they need plenty of alone time together.

08:16.287 --> 08:16.847
Alone time.

08:19.767 --> 08:21.728
Huan'er, you haven't read
enough romance novels.

08:22.327 --> 08:24.087
Look how slow your romantic progress is.

08:25.128 --> 08:27.048
I haven't read enough romance novels?

08:27.847 --> 08:30.488
I've read more romance novels
than salt you've eaten.

08:30.767 --> 08:32.287
Then you weren't paying attention.

08:32.287 --> 08:34.088
You're not applying
the techniques flexibly.

08:35.647 --> 08:36.767
I read them at triple speed.

08:57.047 --> 08:58.807
Lin Huan'er, come in.

09:01.647 --> 09:02.287
Good morning.

09:02.807 --> 09:03.287
Morning.

09:11.128 --> 09:13.807
Mr. Gao, you wanted to confirm
your schedule with me, right?

09:13.927 --> 09:16.287
There's a trial sales event
tomorrow at 3 PM.

09:16.287 --> 09:18.248
I sent you an email earlier
to confirm this.

09:18.248 --> 09:19.567
Mr. Gao, any other instructions?

09:19.567 --> 09:21.167
If not, I'll get back to work.

09:29.728 --> 09:33.287
If anything I've done has made you
feel uncomfortable

09:33.287 --> 09:34.088
at work

09:34.448 --> 09:35.687
or if you really dislike it...

09:35.687 --> 09:36.647
I don't dislike it.

09:37.887 --> 09:39.047
Then why?

09:42.248 --> 09:44.527
It's just...

09:47.407 --> 09:48.328
I'm going back to work.

10:31.368 --> 10:31.848
Luo.

10:34.848 --> 10:35.488
What's up?

10:35.767 --> 10:36.407
Where's Mr. Gao?

10:37.008 --> 10:38.927
He's sick.
I don't know where he went yesterday.

10:38.927 --> 10:40.567
- He likely caught a chill.
- Is it serious?

10:40.968 --> 10:42.008
Burning up at 40 degrees.

10:42.368 --> 10:44.887
His parents are abroad,
so there's no one to look after him.

10:45.448 --> 10:45.968
What?

10:45.968 --> 10:47.807
Why not visit the hospital
with such a fever?

10:47.807 --> 10:49.047
I told him. He refused.

10:49.407 --> 10:50.608
You know Mr. Gao.

10:50.848 --> 10:51.968
Work comes before health.

10:52.488 --> 10:54.047
He asked me to bring some files to him.

10:54.287 --> 10:55.047
Alright, I'm off.

10:55.368 --> 10:55.887
Luo,

10:57.088 --> 10:58.167
I'll come with you.

11:00.728 --> 11:02.448
I need to deliver a file to him anyway.

11:02.448 --> 11:03.407
He needs to confirm it.

11:04.647 --> 11:05.328
Fine.

11:19.368 --> 11:20.807
There's a lot to do at the office.

11:20.807 --> 11:21.968
You go ahead. I'm leaving.

11:44.647 --> 11:45.960
(Mr. Gao, Lin Huan'er is there.)

12:13.167 --> 12:13.848
Gao Haiming?

12:15.887 --> 12:16.488
You're here.

12:17.287 --> 12:18.687
How did you get so sick?

12:21.887 --> 12:24.128
I caught a chill and got a cold.

12:25.567 --> 12:29.248
Did you bring the trial sales report?

12:31.167 --> 12:31.807
I did bring it.

12:31.807 --> 12:33.167
But you shouldn't look at it now.

12:33.328 --> 12:34.208
Get better first.

12:34.728 --> 12:35.328
It's fine.

12:35.767 --> 12:36.728
Taken any medicine?

12:39.208 --> 12:41.567
Wait, where are Mr. Lu and Ms. Fang?

12:41.567 --> 12:42.848
Why is no one looking after you?

12:43.848 --> 12:46.248
They had some family matters
to attend to.

12:46.968 --> 12:48.368
I let them go handle those matters.

12:48.527 --> 12:51.608
Both of them have family matters
at the same time?

12:51.848 --> 12:52.728
Such a coincidence.

12:57.047 --> 12:57.488
Right.

13:00.328 --> 13:01.088
I see.

13:01.407 --> 13:03.927
Could it be they're a couple?

13:05.008 --> 13:05.448
Yes.

13:06.807 --> 13:07.608
That explains it.

13:10.008 --> 13:11.248
Did you take your temperature?

13:12.848 --> 13:14.527
Not yet.

13:17.248 --> 13:18.848
- What are you doing?
- Stay back.

13:18.848 --> 13:19.527
I may infect you.

13:19.687 --> 13:21.687
It's fine. Where's your first-aid kit?

13:21.687 --> 13:22.368
I'll get it.

13:23.047 --> 13:23.848
No need, really.

13:23.848 --> 13:24.647
A lie-down will do.

13:24.887 --> 13:25.567
That won't do.

13:25.567 --> 13:26.848
Let's see if you have a fever.

13:26.848 --> 13:28.088
- A lie-down will do.
- I'll get it.

13:28.088 --> 13:29.287
- I'm fine.
- I'll find it.

13:29.287 --> 13:29.887
Lie down.

13:29.887 --> 13:30.328
I...

13:35.488 --> 13:36.448
What happened?

13:37.208 --> 13:39.488
He told us to take a break.
Let's do as he said.

13:40.008 --> 13:40.567
Alright.

13:41.287 --> 13:43.887
But why do I feel my ears burning?

13:45.248 --> 13:46.567
Mine feel a bit warm too.

13:56.128 --> 13:59.767
Here. Take it first.
I'll check out in a few minutes.

14:23.088 --> 14:26.088
I didn't notice you had so many
fighter jet models last time I was here.

14:27.088 --> 14:27.687
Yeah.

14:35.208 --> 14:36.567
Is that one new?

14:36.567 --> 14:39.008
It looks very similar to the one before.

14:40.167 --> 14:42.287
Look closely. They are different.

14:43.887 --> 14:44.488
Are they?

14:47.567 --> 14:48.287
Let me see.

14:53.728 --> 14:55.728
I can't see any difference at all.

14:56.407 --> 14:56.968
Is it time?

14:57.608 --> 14:58.608
Not yet.

15:00.647 --> 15:01.567
It's almost time.

15:01.608 --> 15:02.248
Not yet.

15:02.368 --> 15:03.088
Let me see.

15:03.488 --> 15:04.248
Not yet.

15:04.848 --> 15:05.567
Give it to me.

15:06.287 --> 15:07.047
No?

15:09.287 --> 15:09.728
Here.

15:13.208 --> 15:15.128
It might be broken.

15:17.527 --> 15:18.687
Forty-two degrees?

15:19.927 --> 15:22.047
How is it possible
to have a fever that high?

15:23.008 --> 15:24.208
You must go to the hospital.

15:24.328 --> 15:25.887
No, I... I don't need to...

15:25.887 --> 15:27.488
No. Forty-two degrees is dangerous.

15:27.488 --> 15:28.488
You could die.

15:28.488 --> 15:29.047
I need rest.

15:29.047 --> 15:30.488
You must go to the hospital. Now.

15:32.927 --> 15:33.767
It's time. Hurry.

15:34.047 --> 15:35.448
Give me the thermometer.

15:35.448 --> 15:36.647
It's not ready yet.

15:37.287 --> 15:39.248
It's ready.
It's definitely been five minutes.

15:39.248 --> 15:40.448
Give it to me.

15:46.008 --> 15:46.687
Fine.

15:55.767 --> 15:56.647
36.8 degrees?

16:03.647 --> 16:07.128
Mr. Gao, if you didn't want to work,
you could've just said so.

16:07.128 --> 16:08.248
Why fake being sick?

16:11.368 --> 16:12.488
The thermometer is broken.

16:13.008 --> 16:13.647
Childish.

16:20.807 --> 16:21.647
Unbelievable.

16:23.128 --> 16:24.728
Tell me, what were you thinking?

16:25.807 --> 16:27.448
If we actually went to the hospital,

16:27.448 --> 16:28.887
what would you tell the doctor?

16:29.047 --> 16:30.287
You'd be found out anyway.

16:31.647 --> 16:32.488
I'd play it by ear.

16:38.167 --> 16:38.984
I'll take you home.

16:50.647 --> 16:51.848
Did you break the car?

16:53.567 --> 16:53.968
I...

17:01.608 --> 17:02.807
Do you know how to fix it?

17:03.287 --> 17:04.127
If you don't,

17:04.127 --> 17:05.327
let's just wait in the car.

17:05.327 --> 17:06.168
It's cold out here.

17:06.168 --> 17:07.567
I can fix it. I really can.

17:15.807 --> 17:16.648
Don't take it off.

17:16.807 --> 17:17.287
It's okay.

17:17.287 --> 17:18.008
Dress warmer.

17:18.008 --> 17:19.287
You'll catch a cold.

17:19.888 --> 17:20.367
It's cold.

17:20.367 --> 17:21.047
I'm fine.

17:28.688 --> 17:29.448
See?

17:31.208 --> 17:32.408
- You're stubborn.
- I'm fine.

17:32.408 --> 17:33.287
- Really.
- Get in.

17:33.287 --> 17:34.248
I can... I can fix it.

17:34.248 --> 17:34.847
Hurry.

17:35.208 --> 17:37.008
Forget about fixing it. Get in the car.

17:40.047 --> 17:40.767
What is it?

17:43.047 --> 17:43.968
39.1 degrees?

17:44.888 --> 17:45.480
Not too bad.

17:46.287 --> 17:47.767
Not too bad?

17:48.527 --> 17:49.807
At least it's not 42 degrees.

17:50.287 --> 17:51.448
How can you even say that?

17:56.688 --> 17:59.888
Now you'll have to stay
and take care of me.

18:04.047 --> 18:05.488
Are you a masochist?

18:07.728 --> 18:08.327
It's okay.

18:09.287 --> 18:11.567
I'm thinking
maybe I should take you to the hospital.

18:12.367 --> 18:13.248
I'm fine.

18:13.607 --> 18:15.287
I took fever reducers.
I'll be better soon.

18:16.888 --> 18:19.767
Then get some rest.

18:20.327 --> 18:21.367
I'll head back now.

18:22.168 --> 18:26.208
Don't you think you should stay
and take care of me?

18:26.767 --> 18:28.248
Aren't Mr. Lu and Ms. Fang here?

18:28.847 --> 18:31.208
They went back home
because of family matters.

18:31.208 --> 18:32.968
Didn't you arrange those family matters?

18:33.327 --> 18:34.327
They did have matters.

18:35.448 --> 18:36.488
I find it hard to believe.

18:36.648 --> 18:37.607
Don't lie to me.

18:41.807 --> 18:42.448
Forget it.

18:43.607 --> 18:44.367
Just go back.

18:45.127 --> 18:46.847
I can take care of myself.

18:50.008 --> 18:51.767
Wait. Alright, alright.

18:51.767 --> 18:53.008
I'll stay to care for you.

18:55.327 --> 18:56.168
Is that really okay?

18:56.448 --> 18:57.448
It's totally okay.

18:57.448 --> 18:58.448
I'll go back tonight.

19:00.327 --> 19:04.008
We'll talk about it when tonight comes.

19:04.728 --> 19:05.567
Tonight, I...

19:07.968 --> 19:10.008
Alright. We'll talk about it later.

19:16.008 --> 19:17.087
Your stomach is growling.

19:18.448 --> 19:19.047
It's yours.

19:23.928 --> 19:25.968
Okay. I'll cook something for you.

19:26.287 --> 19:27.607
No. Just stay in bed.

19:28.208 --> 19:29.408
Who do you think I am?

19:29.807 --> 19:31.168
I can cook as well.

19:31.888 --> 19:32.408
Just wait.

19:46.168 --> 19:47.208
No.

19:47.968 --> 19:49.607
Stir-frying is too complicated.

19:49.607 --> 19:50.567
I don't know how.

19:51.248 --> 19:54.127
But if it's soup or congee,

19:54.127 --> 19:55.287
that takes too long.

19:55.847 --> 19:56.648
What should I do?

20:48.552 --> 20:52.424
♪Old photos, yellowed♪

20:52.424 --> 20:56.872
♪Timelines, tangled♪

20:58.888 --> 20:59.488
Try it.

20:59.728 --> 21:00.208
Okay.

21:01.008 --> 21:01.767
You know what?

21:02.087 --> 21:04.968
My pasta is way better than Angel Hair.

21:10.408 --> 21:10.968
How is it?

21:11.607 --> 21:12.168
It's good.

21:12.767 --> 21:13.527
What inspired this?

21:15.327 --> 21:16.567
I discovered by accident

21:17.168 --> 21:19.168
that a rice cooker
is perfect for lazy cooks.

21:23.528 --> 21:31.112
♪Love's time machine,
flies, flies, flies♪

21:31.112 --> 21:39.102
♪Through centuries, just to meet you♪

21:39.103 --> 21:46.879
♪Love's time machine keeps on turning♪

21:46.879 --> 21:52.424
♪Streaking across the sky♪

21:55.888 --> 21:56.527
Are you full?

21:59.607 --> 22:02.488
Then I'll clean the dishes later
and head home.

22:10.287 --> 22:12.527
Stay here tonight.

22:15.168 --> 22:18.448
I... I'm worried
my fever might spike tonight.

22:20.607 --> 22:21.448
But I...

22:22.367 --> 22:24.367
Where could I sleep if I stay?

22:25.248 --> 22:25.968
The guest room.

22:27.607 --> 22:29.287
I didn't bring toiletries.

22:30.008 --> 22:31.016
The guest room has some.

22:32.087 --> 22:34.168
I don't have a change of clothes either.

22:36.248 --> 22:37.287
You can wear mine.

22:38.056 --> 22:45.965
♪Through centuries, just to meet you♪

22:48.208 --> 22:48.607
Then...

22:51.728 --> 22:53.648
Then I should call Mengmeng
and let her know.

22:56.287 --> 22:57.008
You rest.

22:59.353 --> 23:09.538
♪Just to hold you♪

23:23.047 --> 23:23.767
What's wrong?

23:24.847 --> 23:25.888
You look so gloomy.

23:26.367 --> 23:27.248
Anything happened?

23:29.127 --> 23:31.208
Every time I think
about the singing competition,

23:31.208 --> 23:33.327
I get really irritable and anxious.

23:34.047 --> 23:35.408
I think I should withdraw.

23:35.847 --> 23:36.488
Why?

23:37.968 --> 23:39.807
Mengmeng, look.

23:40.287 --> 23:42.567
You sing beautifully.

23:42.847 --> 23:43.847
And you're so gorgeous.

23:44.168 --> 23:45.527
You'd win just by standing there.

23:46.888 --> 23:48.488
It's not that simple.

23:48.728 --> 23:50.287
This is a major competition after all.

23:50.968 --> 23:53.688
I've seen many contestants on TV before.

23:53.928 --> 23:55.688
Some have even released albums.

23:57.287 --> 24:00.888
I... I'm not a professional, and...

24:07.367 --> 24:08.847
Hello? Huan'er?

24:12.087 --> 24:14.527
Mengmeng, well, I...

24:14.888 --> 24:16.567
I won't be back tonight.

24:18.807 --> 24:19.888
Are you going home?

24:20.008 --> 24:20.807
For how many days?

24:21.567 --> 24:23.208
Just two or three days.

24:24.087 --> 24:25.248
I'm not quite sure yet.

24:26.127 --> 24:27.208
Okay. Talk to you later.

24:27.527 --> 24:29.807
Wait. Something's off.
What are you doing?

24:30.168 --> 24:32.888
I'm chatting with Hu Tiehan.

24:33.527 --> 24:34.567
I need to go.

24:36.327 --> 24:37.527
Romance over friendship.

24:40.127 --> 24:40.847
Mengmeng,

24:42.448 --> 24:43.847
just hold onto your happiness.

24:55.127 --> 24:58.527
I didn't expect you to still keep it.

25:01.327 --> 25:05.047
You gave me that
for my birthday in 11th grade.

25:05.287 --> 25:06.968
I tucked it into my wallet back then.

25:06.968 --> 25:08.087
And it's been there since.

25:15.168 --> 25:17.208
I remember that year for your birthday,

25:17.888 --> 25:19.087
the whole class came.

25:19.767 --> 25:24.047
They gave you brand-name stuff,
imported snacks,

25:24.047 --> 25:25.287
3D greeting cards, and so on.

25:25.688 --> 25:28.728
And I just gave you this thing.

25:29.488 --> 25:31.208
What do you mean by that?

25:31.728 --> 25:35.208
For me, this was the best gift
I received that year.

25:38.807 --> 25:42.488
How can something bought with money
compare to the thing you drew?

25:47.688 --> 25:49.047
In my eyes, you are also the best.

25:56.888 --> 25:59.527
I mean in the singing competition.

26:00.968 --> 26:05.688
Yes, some have released albums
as professionals,

26:06.327 --> 26:08.847
and have shown it to everyone on TV.

26:09.248 --> 26:10.087
But so what?

26:11.287 --> 26:12.807
I believe your only rival is yourself.

26:14.367 --> 26:15.448
At least I think

26:17.047 --> 26:17.767
you are unique.

26:18.607 --> 26:19.688
Your singing is the best.

26:20.648 --> 26:25.008
You have your own naturalness
and purity. You're irreplaceable.

26:34.648 --> 26:36.208
I need to use the restroom.

27:08.688 --> 27:10.408
(Miss Lin, please come in.)

27:19.248 --> 27:20.648
(What are your orders, Mr. Gao?)

27:27.367 --> 27:28.847
(I should take my medicine now.)

27:30.968 --> 27:33.607
(Take the fever reducer thrice daily
and one pill each time.)

27:33.607 --> 27:35.728
(Cooling patches
are in the nightstand's top drawer.)

27:35.728 --> 27:38.208
(Hot water is in the thermos.
Please help yourself.)

27:55.767 --> 27:56.367
(Okay.)

28:03.168 --> 28:04.807
You've triggered an impromptu quest.

28:04.928 --> 28:06.527
The quest is Compulsory Wall Slam.

28:06.728 --> 28:08.208
Complete it within three minutes.

28:08.367 --> 28:09.047
Or it expires.

28:10.127 --> 28:11.448
Compulsory Wall Slam?

28:13.408 --> 28:14.488
Are you kidding me?

28:14.767 --> 28:16.208
What kind of lousy quest is this?

28:16.527 --> 28:17.367
I won't do it.

28:19.448 --> 28:21.488
If you fail
to complete the quest in time,

28:21.488 --> 28:23.087
you will face system punishment.

28:23.767 --> 28:24.968
Go ahead and punish me.

28:24.968 --> 28:26.047
Isn't it just a reset?

28:26.448 --> 28:27.488
Reset it.

28:27.968 --> 28:28.888
Why don't you

28:29.127 --> 28:32.127
just send me back
to before I even came here?

28:32.127 --> 28:32.847
End it all.

28:33.208 --> 28:34.488
Player, please carefully use

28:34.488 --> 28:36.287
the time rewind feature after spoilers.

28:36.408 --> 28:38.448
You only have one chance left.

28:40.648 --> 28:42.168
I've always wondered what will happen

28:42.168 --> 28:43.168
when they're used up.

28:43.928 --> 28:45.047
You claim it's serious,

28:45.047 --> 28:46.488
but never say what'll happen.

28:47.008 --> 28:48.367
The consequences will be severe.

28:48.367 --> 28:49.367
Please be cautious.

28:49.767 --> 28:51.168
Three-minute countdown begins now.

28:51.567 --> 28:52.168
Wait, wait.

29:01.408 --> 29:02.047
What's up?

29:04.888 --> 29:06.056
Did you take your medicine?

29:08.367 --> 29:09.087
I did.

29:11.287 --> 29:12.087
Well...

29:15.408 --> 29:17.168
Do you need something?

29:18.208 --> 29:19.607
No, I'm just checking on you.

29:21.968 --> 29:23.567
Do you want to get up and walk around?

29:26.448 --> 29:26.968
No.

29:28.327 --> 29:29.008
You don't?

29:29.767 --> 29:31.248
You've been lying down for so long.

29:31.607 --> 29:33.168
Get up and move around.

29:34.287 --> 29:35.607
Didn't you tell me to rest?

29:35.807 --> 29:36.367
Yes,

29:37.287 --> 29:38.287
but actually,

29:38.728 --> 29:41.047
sitting like this for so long
impedes blood circulation.

29:41.488 --> 29:43.327
It's bad for recovering from a cold.

29:43.688 --> 29:45.607
Get up and walk around a little.

29:45.607 --> 29:47.087
You'll recover from the cold faster.

29:49.287 --> 29:51.968
Then I'll do so after my fever breaks.

29:52.488 --> 29:54.408
One minute remaining
for the timed quest.

29:54.408 --> 29:55.728
Player, please hurry.

29:57.047 --> 29:58.168
Don't you enjoy walking?

29:58.408 --> 29:59.087
Let's walk.

30:00.168 --> 30:01.408
- No time to explain.
- Wait...

30:01.408 --> 30:02.607
- Hurry.
- I... I'm not ready.

30:02.607 --> 30:03.287
You are.

30:04.008 --> 30:05.287
- Wait.
- Didn't you take medicine?

30:06.008 --> 30:07.087
Where are you going?

30:07.567 --> 30:08.928
I'll go here.

30:25.527 --> 30:27.807
Congratulations
on completing the timed quest.

30:28.248 --> 30:28.968
Congratulations.

30:29.047 --> 30:31.648
The target's fondness toward you
has increased to 82 percent.

30:42.728 --> 30:43.527
What's this?

30:45.688 --> 30:46.448
Well,

30:47.047 --> 30:49.008
I was just worried that with your fever,

30:49.008 --> 30:50.248
you might be unsteady.

30:52.327 --> 30:54.047
I was just fine lying down earlier.

30:55.168 --> 30:58.367
Then maybe
you're better off resting in bed.

31:00.807 --> 31:02.648
You should go back and lie down now.

31:02.888 --> 31:05.767
I... I'll get back to work.

31:34.888 --> 31:35.807
Thank you.

31:37.248 --> 31:37.728
No problem.

31:44.327 --> 31:44.928
Well...

31:54.408 --> 31:55.047
I'm leaving.

31:55.767 --> 31:57.047
Do you want to come in and eat?

31:57.047 --> 31:58.087
It's mealtime right now.

31:58.767 --> 32:00.168
No thanks, I still have duty.

32:00.968 --> 32:01.648
I'll go now.

32:03.527 --> 32:04.327
Okay.

32:06.127 --> 32:06.847
Bye.

32:07.287 --> 32:07.968
Bye.

32:13.448 --> 32:14.087
Mengmeng.

32:17.928 --> 32:19.047
Are you free in a few days?

32:19.888 --> 32:20.567
Yes.

32:51.847 --> 32:52.488
Gao Haiming?

33:28.993 --> 33:31.976
♪Entwined worries linger♪

33:33.185 --> 33:35.956
♪My heart is not empty,
yet pain remains♪

33:37.857 --> 33:43.770
♪Now I see what passed between us♪

33:45.567 --> 33:48.627
♪Walking through the crowd to meet you♪

33:49.793 --> 33:53.245
♪Going through surging tides of people♪

33:54.241 --> 33:59.767
♪Until the world's end♪

34:02.177 --> 34:05.973
♪If I could♪

34:06.561 --> 34:09.377
♪Keep loving you♪

34:10.401 --> 34:12.801
♪Hearing two hearts♪

34:12.801 --> 34:17.717
♪Beating together♪

34:18.689 --> 34:22.553
♪If I could♪

34:22.553 --> 34:25.793
♪Stay resting in your arms♪

34:26.849 --> 34:34.174
♪I'd trade the rest of my life for it♪

